# One Linux-hosted UCRT toolchain cross-builds both Windows architectures. The
# component revisions describe the upstream inputs used for this exact,
# SHA-256-pinned llvm-mingw release archive. Clang exposes the LLVM revision at
# runtime; MinGW-w64 exposes its version/state in _mingw_mac.h, while its
# revision provenance is bound to the authenticated toolchain archive.
